        "name": "USN-2431-2",
        "description": "USN-2431-1 fixed vulnerabilities in mod_wsgi. The security update exposed an issue in the MAAS package, causing a regression. This update fixes the problem.  We apologize for the inconvenience.  Original advisory details:   It was discovered that mod_wsgi incorrectly handled errors when setting up  the working directory and group access rights. A malicious application  could possibly use this issue to cause a local privilege escalation when  using daemon mode.",
